  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "もっと広い家に引っ越そう  (Let Us Move to a Bigger House)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "mayumi": "真由美",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "sachiko": "幸子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "From zero contracts to number one in the entire company, Muranishi comes home beaming with his sales award. Over dinner he promises toys to the children and a bigger home to his wife Sachiko. Listen to the family celebrate.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今月の営業成績は一位だったぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "本当に？信じられない！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今度リカちゃんハウスを買ってやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "絶対約束だからね！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大輔にはカウンタックのラジコンを買ってやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "大丈夫なの？そんな約束をして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、大丈夫だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もっと広い家に引っ越そうな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "楽しみね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいはい、任せとけ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "でも仕事のほうはうまくいってよかったじゃない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "期待してますよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今月の営業成績は一位だったぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My sales record this month was number one!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "信じられない！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot believe it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今度リカちゃんハウスを買ってやる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next time I will buy you a Licca-chan dollhouse.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "絶対約束だからね！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is an absolute promise, okay!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "大丈夫なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it really okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もっと広い家に引っ越そうな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us move to a bigger house, too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "楽しみね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Something to look forward to, is it not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はいはい、任せとけ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, yes, leave it to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "でも仕事のほうはうまくいってよかったじゃない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, I am so glad things went well with your work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sachiko",
      "t": "期待してますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am counting on you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
